OL,3,GNEWSATikTok declines invite to discuss
OL,4,Adangerous driving videos
OL,5,
OL,6,FTikTok has declined an invitation to
OL,7,Fappear before an Irish parliamentary
OL,8,Fcommittee on media to discuss the
OL,9,Fposting of videos of people driving the
OL,10,Fwrong way down motorways.
OL,12,FFive teenagers were killed while
OL,13,Fdriving the wrong way down a motorway
OL,14,Fin County Kildare in the early hours of
OL,15,FSunday.
OL,17,FFour people - three women and a
OL,18,Fseven-year-old boy were injured - two
OL,19,Fof the women critically and the other
OL,20,Fwoman and the boy seriously.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
