OL,3,GNEWSATikTok declines invite to discuss
OL,4,Adangerous driving videos
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a letter seen by Irish broadcaster
OL,7,FRTE, external, a TikTok spokesperson
OL,8,Fsaid they could not attend because of
OL,9,Fthe ongoing police investigation and a
OL,10,Fseparate examination by Coimisiun na
OL,11,FMean, Ireland's media regulator.
